Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "CyclistCrossingIntersectionAtNight" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :BehaviorAnomaly ;
    :hasActor :cyclist1 ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :night1 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 ;
    :occursInScene :scene1 .

:cyclist1 a :Cyclist ;
    :description "Cyclist crossing intersection in front of ego vehicle" .

:night1 a :NightCondition .

:risk1 a :PedestrianCollisionRisk ;
    :description "Collision risk with cyclist crossing the ego vehicle's path at night" ;
    :confidenceScore "0.95"^^xsd:float ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.90"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Collision risk with cyclist crossing the ego vehicle's path at night
Severity Score: 0.90